                <a id="corresp-c1" aria-label="email Tongwu Zhang" href="mailto:tongwu.zhang@nih.gov">Tongwu Zhang</a>.</p></div></div></section><section data-title="Ethics declarations"><div class="c-article-section" id="ethics-section"><h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="ethics">Ethics declarations</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="ethics-content">
            
            <p><b>Conflicts of interest</b> Mengyan Zhang, Junjie Li, Yan Zhang, and Tongwu Zhang declare that they have no conflicts of interest.</p>
            <p>This manuscript is a review article and does not involve human participants or animal experiments. Therefore, approval from an institutional review board or ethics committee was not required.</p>
